  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For non-trivial solution, using Cramer&#39;s rule, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, only one value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math></p>"
  }
